OL,3,GNEWSASoldier left partially deaf by
OL,4,Asingle punch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fractured a soldier's skull
OL,7,Fand left him partially deaf with a
OL,8,Fsingle punch while on a night out has
OL,9,Fbeen given a suspended sentence.
OL,11,FBryan Coombs, 52, struck the victim
OL,12,Foutside a bar in Sunderland city centre
OL,13,Fon 2 December 2023, Newcastle Crown
OL,14,FCourt heard, with the attacker only
OL,15,Fidentified months later following a
OL,16,Fpublic appeal by police.
OL,18,FThe victim said he had had to fight to
OL,19,Fprove he was still fit to be in the
OL,20,FArmy and the potential loss of his
OL,21,Fcareer had been devastating.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
