OL,3,GNEWSASoldier left partially deaf by
OL,4,Asingle punch
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoombs, from Sunderland, initially
OL,7,Fdenied wrongdoing but on the day he was
OL,8,Fdue to stand trial admitted causing
OL,9,Fgrievous bodily harm and was jailed for
OL,10,Fnine months suspended for 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
